            <ArticleTitle>Drs. William J. Mayo and Franklin H. Martin: Leaders in establishing the College’s unique identity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>53-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As Past-President, [Dr. Mayo] accompanied Dr. Martin on an official trip to Panama, Peru, Chile, Argentina, and Uruguay in 1920, where they met with presidents as well as leading surgeons and health officials. A number of prominent South American surgeons received Fellowship in the College, establishing a connection that endures to this day.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
